    "detailed_description": "Game Description:<br />\r\n3D horizontal board shooting fixed viewing angle.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow it works:<br />\r\nFireball: Left mouse button<br />\r\nMove: A/D<br />\r\nJump: W<br />\r\nSuspension: ESC<br />\r\nToggle Full Screen/Window: F11<br />\r\n<br />\r\nClearance Conditions:<br />\r\n1. Destroy the zombie hut.<br />\r\n2. Destroy the Mutant Chef.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnd Conditions:<br />\r\n1. Get too close to monsters.<br />\r\n2. Close the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPS: There is only one level, and the progress cannot be saved!",
